{"id":"n70459-1-10","stage":1,"title":"유리 · 玻璃","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70459-1-10-1","ko":"바닥에 웬 유리 조각들이야?","zh":"地上怎么会有玻璃碎片啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}},{"text":"유리","meaning":"玻璃","explanation":"유리：玻璃","readings":[{"term":"유리","audio":"/audio/4b585bc5692d408917f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70459","senseId":"1","lemma":"유리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유리","audio":"/audio/4b585bc5692d408917f2.mp3"}},{"text":"조각들이야?","meaning":"块儿，碎片","explanation":"조각：块儿，碎片；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"조각","audio":"/audio/652d4b53b484a0620da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24575","senseId":"1","lemma":"조각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조각들이야","audio":"/audio/5f6bfb71d74651169a2c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"4b585bc5692d4089","term":"유리","zh":"玻璃","audio":"/audio/4b585bc5692d408917f2.mp3","entryId":"70459","definition":"透明坚硬易碎的物质，被用来做窗户或镜子等。","pronunciation":["유리"]},{"id":"652d4b53